    "finalPromptText": "I'm working on a research paper for my statistics class on the history of data visualization, focused on The Visual Display of Quantitative Information (1983) by Edward R. Tufte.\n\n1. Find background on the book and the author.\n2. Summarize the main themes and arguments.\n3. Find critical reception and reviews from 1983 onward.\n4. List Tufte's later major works on information design and how they relate to this 1983 book.",
